Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:56:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ENGHOME: the main page's all-axes HOME reaches the 1203 card
 -- WB_ENGINE_MOTOR_1203 and WB_PUMP_1203_START_RING on (EastSun 1002 "both
 on"); F5 debug / release entries
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1002「主畫面全軸 HOME：目前不會送到卡上->修好」. ProcessMotorHome -> TMyMotor::MotorHome ->
TMyEtherCatMotor::EtherCatMotHome ended in the #else stub (EcatMotorRoute() null) because
WB_ENGINE_MOTOR_1203 was commented out: nothing reached the card, MotorHome timed out after 90 s
(HomeFlag=2). The route refuses to install without WB_PUMP_1203_START_RING (Q9), so EastSun chose
both: at card open ring 0 gets Acm_MasStartRing; every ENGINE move (HOME now, START later) is live.
tools/pci1203_control_gate.ps1 $expectActive: WB_ENGINE_MOTOR_1203 = $true (START_RING was already
expected true). The gate still exits 1 on an old, unrelated finding (Pci1203AxisIniTick has 2 call
sites in tools/wb_serve.cpp since the 0930 packages 68-76 merge); the macro checks agree.
MachineType.h: only these two lines (SOFT_SIMULTE commented out in the working tree is EastSun's, not committed).

.vscode: for one test session F5 (★★) ran the gdb entry on build_integ_dbg_x86 (breakpoints did not
bind: F5 ran the noDebug entry on a build with no -g); EastSun then asked for release again, so ★★ =
the no-debugger shipping build, renamed "★★ IOWEB(這台): build + IO web（release，不接除錯器，port 8055）".
The DEBUG entry ("IOWEB(這台): wb_serve DEBUG 可下中斷點", "1203 唯讀" dropped -- control is LIVE)
now first checks for an old wb_serve (new task "檢查舊程式 + 等待畫面 + build wb_serve DEBUG（-g）").

o2 built with these (see PKG-128); ctest Pci1203MotorRoute passes (its gate branch follows the macros).
